/*
 * Explicit template solving for instruction-level template parameters.
 *
 * TemplateExplicitInstructionSolving handles template parameters that appear
 * in instruction-like contexts, such as:
 *
 *     T: type = expr
 *     V: value = expr
 *     F: fn(...)-> ... = lambda
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve::explicit::instruction
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve/explicit/instruction.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-13
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
